# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prettier ignore list (frontend-standard plan, Phase 1, 2026-10-02).
#
# Prettier only formats CONVERTED JavaScript under src/ (see the `format` and
# `format:check` scripts in package.json and `lint-staged.config.js`). The
# TypeScript files are reformatted when each folder is converted (Phase 4), not
# before, so unrelated PRs do not carry whole-file formatting churn. This file
# covers editors and ad-hoc `npx prettier` runs.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Build output and dependencies (boilerplate parity)
dist/
coverage/
node_modules/

# Lock files & generated (boilerplate parity)
package-lock.json
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent worktrees: full copies of this repo, never formatted from here
.claude/

# Canon documents: tables and quoted figures are hand-aligned and cited by
# line; reformatting them would break those citations.
*.md
docs/

# Secrets (boilerplate parity)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
